"The origin at the end depends on how the flag is set: `+{command line}+` for `JAVA_OPTS_APPEND` or the `java` command, `+{environment}+` for `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`.\n"
"What matters is `UseBASE64Intrinsics = false`."
